  "body": "It currently says:\n\n> The form IDL attribute must return the label element's labeled control's form owner, or\n> null if there isn't a labeled control or there is but is has no form owner.\n\nI think it should say something more like:\n\n> If the label element has no labeled control, or its labeled control is not a form-associated element, the form IDL attribute must return null.  Otherwise, the form IDL attribute must return the label element's labeled control's form owner (which can still be null).\n",
